oo late, realizing that it is already too late!</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Establishing a Good Health Concept</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The fast-paced modern life is like an invisible hand, pushing us forward, but also, unintentionally, changing our lifestyle and eating habits. Irregular sleep patterns, high-fat and high-salt diets, and other habits gradually erode our health, causing the shadow of chronic diseases to loom over our lives.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Even more serious is that we still pay far too little attention to health. In the past, people focused on economic development and material improvement, forgetting that health is the foundation of life. What we need is not just medical technology that advances with each day but also a deep understanding of health concepts and the conscious development of healthy behaviors.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Health is a matter of urgency for everyone. We must cherish our bodies and remind ourselves at all times that health is what truly matters. Do not wait until health is lost and then regret it.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Supplying Peptides Is Urgent</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Diseases are like sly hunters lurking in the shadows, always ready to attack. Their existence is silent, but they are incredibly powerful. If ignored, they can spread rapidly and become a raging fire that threatens our lives. Supplementing peptides, a powerful tool for health management, is one of our essential weapons against diseases and maintaining good health.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Peptide supplementation, as the name implies, refers to supplementing the peptides required by the body. The human body naturally contains small peptides, but with age, these peptides gradually decrease, leading to the decline of various bodily functions. Therefore, timely supplementation of peptides is crucial for maintaining good health.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Small peptides, like an intimate guardian, build a solid barrier for our health, enhancing our ability to resist external illnesses. They also help the body better absorb nutrients and prevent the onset of chronic diseases.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Remember, health is our valuable wealth. Only by maintaining good health can we enjoy life and pursue our dreams. Without health, we cannot enjoy the beauty of life, cannot accompany our families, and cannot achieve our dreams.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">So, for yourself, for your family, for your loved ones, start your health management now! In this era full of challenges and opportunities, let us move forward together, using peptide supplementation as a tool to safeguard our health journey.</p>', 3, '/api/personal-heath/v1.0/file/getFile?fileName=news pic/8.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2024-09-08 16:11:31', 1);
INSERT INTO `news` VALUES (9, 'The Shadow of Chronic Diseases Gradually Looms Over Our Lives', '<p> </p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">In the past, with the rapid economic development in China, many people\'s living standards and material conditions have greatly improved. However, behind this rapid development, some neglected issues have emerged, among the most prominent being health problems. As the economy slows down and society gradually moves toward harmony, people are starting to realize that health is a more important part of life.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>The Health Data of Chinese People is Shocking!</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Through careful collection and sorting, we have obtained a detailed set of data on the health status of Chinese people. These aren\'t just cold, hard statistics; they are like living beings telling us the value of health.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Hypertension — 160 to 170 million people</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Hyperlipidemia — over 100 million people</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Diabetes patients — 92.4 million people</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Overweight or Obesity — 70 million to 200 million people</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Abnormal blood lipids — 160 million people</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Fatty liver patients — 120 million people</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Every 30 seconds, one person is diagnosed with cancer,</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Every 30 seconds, one person is diagnosed with diabetes,</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Every 30 seconds, at least one person dies from cardiovascular diseases.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Behind these cold numbers are the suffering and helplessness of countless families. They silently tell a cruel truth: in the busy rush of life, we often neglect our health in the pursuit of money and material enjoyment. When health issues rise like a hidden tide, we wake up only to realize that it is too late!</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Establishing a Good Health Concept</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The fast-paced modern life is like an invisible hand, pushing us forward, but inadvertently changing our lifestyles and eating habits. Irregular sleep patterns and high-fat, high-salt diets quietly erode our health, causing the shadow of chronic diseases to gradually loom over our lives.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">What is even more alarming is that we still do not pay enough attention to health. In the past, people were fixated on economic development and the improvement of material conditions, forgetting that health is the foundation of life. What we need is not just the advancement of medical technology, but a deep-seated health concept and the conscious development of healthy behaviors.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Health is urgent for everyone. We must cherish our bodies and constantly remind ourselves that health is the most important thing. Don\'t wait until we lose our health to regret it.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Supplementing Peptides Is Urgent</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Diseases are like cunning hunters lurking in the dark, ready to attack us at any time. Their existence is silent but incredibly powerful, and once ignored, they can quickly spread and become a raging fire that threatens our lives. And peptide supplementation, a powerful tool for health management, is key to fighting diseases and maintaining our health.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Peptide supplementation, as the name suggests, involves replenishing the peptides the body needs. The human body already contains small molecules of peptides, but as we age, these peptides decrease, leading to a gradual decline in bodily functions. Therefore, timely supplementation of peptides is crucial for maintaining health.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Small molecule peptides act as close guardians, building a solid barrier for our health, enhancing our resistance against external pathogens, and helping the body absorb nutrients better, thus preventing the onset of chronic diseases.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Remember, health is our precious wealth. Only with a healthy body can we better enjoy life and pursue our dreams. Without health, we cannot enjoy the beauty of life, accompany our loved ones, or achieve our dreams.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">So, for ourselves, for our families, and for our friends, health management starts now! In this age full of challenges and opportunities, let’s move forward together, using peptide supplementation as our tool to safeguard our health journey.</p>', 2, '/api/personal-heath/v1.0/file/getFile?fileName=news pic/9.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2024-09-09 16:12:23', 1);
INSERT INTO `news` VALUES (10, 'How to Establish a Healthy Lifestyle: Effective Health Management Tips', '<p> </p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">In the past, with the rapid development of China\'s economy, many people\'s living standards and material conditions have greatly improved. However, behind this rapid development, there are some overlooked problems, one of the most prominent being health issues. As the economic growth slows down and society gradually becomes more harmonious, people are beginning to realize that health is a more important part of life.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Shocking Health Data of Chinese People!</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Through careful collection and organization, we obtained a set of detailed data on the health status of Chinese people. These are not just cold statistics, but rather, they represent vibrant lives telling us the value of health.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Hypertension - 160-170 million people</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Hyperlipidemia - over 100 million people</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Diabetes patients - 92.4 million people</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Overweight or obesity - 70 million to 200 million people</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Dyslipidemia - 160 million people</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Fatty liver patients - 120 million people</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">On average, every 30 seconds, one person is diagnosed with cancer,</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">On average, every 30 seconds, one person is diagnosed with diabetes,</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">On average, every 30 seconds, at least one person dies from cardiovascular disease.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Behind these cold numbers are the pain and helplessness of countless families. They silently tell a cruel truth: in the busy pace of life, we often neglect our health in pursuit of money and material pleasures. When health problems come like a silent tide, we awaken only to realize it is too late!</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Establishing a Good Health Concept</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The fast-paced modern life is like an invisible hand, pushing us forward, yet unknowingly, it has caused significant changes in our lifestyle and eating habits. Irregular sleep patterns, high-fat and high-salt diets, etc., quietly erode our health, causing the shadow of chronic diseases to gradually envelop our lives.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">What is even more severe is that our awareness of health is still far from enough. In the past, people focused on economic development and improvements in material conditions, but forgot that health is the foundation of life. What we need is not only the ever-advancing medical technology, but also the deep-rooted health concept and the conscious cultivation of healthy behaviors.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Health is urgent for everyone. We must cherish our bodies and always remind ourselves that health is the most important. Don\'t wait until you lose your health to regret it.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Peptide Supplementation is Urgent</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Diseases, like a cunning hunter lurking in the shadows, are always ready to attack us. Its existence is silent but powerful. If we neglect it, it may quickly spread and become a raging fire threatening our life safety. Peptide supplementation, an essential tool in health management, is our key weapon against disease and in maintaining health.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Peptide supplementation, as the name suggests, is the replenishment of the peptide substances needed by the body. The human body contains small molecular peptides, but with age, these peptide substances gradually decrease, leading to a decline in various body functions. Therefore, timely supplementation of peptides is crucial for maintaining body health.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Small molecular peptides, like a caring guardian, build a solid shield for our health, making us more resistant to external diseases and helping our bodies better absorb nutrients to prevent chronic diseases.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Remember, health is our precious wealth. Only with a healthy body can we better enjoy life and pursue our dreams. Without health, we cannot enjoy the beauty of life, accompany our family, or realize our dreams.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Therefore, for yourself, for your family, and for your loved ones, start health care and wellness from now! In this era full of challenges and opportunities, let\'s move forward together and use peptide supplementation, this health management tool, to protect our health.</p>', 3, '/api/personal-heath/v1.0/file/getFile?fileName=news pic/10.jpg', NULL, 0, '2024-07-16 16:12:56', 1);
INSERT INTO `news` VALUES (11, 'For Family and Friends, Start Health Management Now!', '<p> </p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">In the past, with the rapid development of China\'s economy, many people\'s living standards and material conditions have greatly improved. However, behind this rapid development, there are some neglected issues, among which health problems are particularly prominent. As the economic growth slows down and society gradually becomes more harmonious, people are beginning to realize that health is a more important part of life.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Shocking Health Data of the Chinese People!</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Through careful collection and organization, we obtained a set of detailed data about the health status of the Chinese people. These are not just cold statistics, but like vibrant lives telling us about the preciousness of health.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Hypertension - 160-170 million people</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Hyperlipidemia - over 100 million people</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Diabetic patients - 92.4 million people</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Overweight or obesity - 70 million to 200 million people</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Abnormal blood lipids - 160 million people</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Fatty liver patients - 120 million people</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Every 30 seconds, one person develops cancer,</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Every 30 seconds, one person develops diabetes,</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Every 30 seconds, at least one person dies from cardiovascular diseases.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Behind these cold numbers, there is the pain and helplessness of countless families. They silently tell a cruel truth: in the busy lives, we often ignore our health in pursuit of money and material pleasures. When health problems arise like hidden currents, we suddenly wake up,